        // NOTE (heap-overlap fix): 0x181560/0x181590/0x1815c0 (pool malloc/free entry
        // points) are NO LONGER HLE-hooked. They now fall through to the default recompiled
        // registration so they use the game's own streaming pool (FUN_00181620 ->
        // FUN_002044f8), exactly like retail. The old HLE_001815c0/HLE_001815f0 routed them
