    //       arm trigger that should set those request bits never fires on host)
    //       => find that trigger (upstream page-reveal/arming gamestate).
    //   * req&geom != 0 but reqdisp == 0 -> requested, but the already-armed
    //       mask suppresses dispatch => *UIsub (armed set) is stale; pin it.
    //   * reqdisp != 0 yet still no geom START in [LOGO-START0] -> slot/pointer
    //       mismatch (geom ptr not in the mgr+0x7d8 slot the iterator reads) =>
    //       re-point the slot wiring.
